  "card": "This PR adds a REST endpoint at /rest/txspendingprevout/ mirroring the gettxspendingprevout RPC method. Users and external applications querying Bitcoin Core over the unauthenticated REST interface previously lacked an endpoint to check whether outpoints were spent in the mempool or confirmed via txospenderindex without falling back to JSON-RPC. The endpoint supports batch lookups of up to 15 outpoints in JSON format with optional mempool_only and return_spending_tx query parameters. It addresses feature parity requested in issue 33808.",
